Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:11.99,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1900,0)}"It is better to receive an injury than to inflict one."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:11.99,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\pos(580,245)}Cicero, "Tusculan Disputations"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:16.02,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Regarding the results of your final exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.04,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You all passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.25,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:26.13,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,We're moving on for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.70,Main_Top,Sudo,0,0,0,,Awesome! You kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.95,Main_Top,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.95,0:00:28.26,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,We get to stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:28.26,Main_Top,Wang,0,0,0,,That's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:28.26,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:32.26,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,For once, I'm unable to find \Nfault with the result anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:35.01,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,That test was easy-peasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:37.32,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Says the class joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:40.16,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Says the guy with the lowest score.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.00,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Hey, don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.19,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You really are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:45.07,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Only stupid people call people stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:47.20,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,You're both stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:47.20,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.39,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:52.16,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Even with the year's final exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.42,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,we haven't seen a single expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.91,0:00:58.82,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,This is unprecedented in \Nthe history of this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:04.92,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Therefore, we will have to \Nhold a follow-up special exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:05.65,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:07.01,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.01,0:01:07.78,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:09.24,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,This is totally out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:10.28,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.60,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Why do we have to do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:12.22,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:13.36,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Tell us why!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:17.17,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,The school admits that you've done very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:18.71,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Then what's the deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:19.81,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:26.94,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\c&H62605E&\3c&HF2F3F1&\pos(251,5)}End-of-Year Test           Total Ranking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:21.69,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,We, the teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:26.56,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,don't take the task of burdening you \Nwith an unexpected exam lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:32.04,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So Chabashira doesn't like how \Nthe school's reacting, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:34.93,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You have no right to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:38.90,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Teacher, what kind of exam is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:41.08,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,The special exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:43.51,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,will be a class vote.
