Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:51.03,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H3C5562&\bord0\shad0\fs12\pos(201.999,255.334)}Discourse on Decadence\N Ango Sakaguchi
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:01.66,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,He's been rather quiet lately, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:02.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Horikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:09.01,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You seem to have time to kill, Ryuen-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.40,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,I was wondering who it might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.99,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,So it's you, Suzune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:16.32,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.68,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Your perpetual tagalong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:24.42,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,So? How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:28.94,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What do you intend to do on \Nthe upcoming special exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:31.44,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:35.20,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,So you don't intend to fight to \Nmake sure you're not expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.95,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:41.79,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm sure many people would \Nbe happy to see you expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:45.78,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,For better or worse, \Nyou've done too much here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:48.48,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No one's going to reach out to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:51.02,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Seeing as you're my enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:54.27,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,taking me out now would be \Nyour best course of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:58.22,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Once I'm gone, Class D won't \Nstand a chance against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:00.47,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You think quite highly of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:04.27,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But you lack the talent \Nthat a true leader needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.50,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's why you fell to Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.98,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:11.03,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,As this might be our last conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:12.95,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,could you tell me one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:17.03,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,If someone like you, \Nstuck in a hopeless situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.77,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,wanted to engage seriously with this test,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:22.43,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,do you think you could escape being expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:25.43,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,What a stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.80,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Of course I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.35,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Empty confidence, but typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:31.25,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Satisfied now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:35.83,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Or do you want me to tell \Nyou my plan for survival?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:36.88,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:40.89,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Hearing it might lead me \Nright into your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:42.79,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Still, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.77,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Seeing you accept reality
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.26,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,helps me to do what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:50.45,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,What needs to be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:53.45,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,If we can't avoid expelling someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:55.49,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I need to determine who's actually worthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.28,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and see that their sentence is carried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:12:02.03,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,That could end up bouncing right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:06.20,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,If it does, I suppose I'll have to accept \Nthat this was the limit of my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.54,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Sounds like empty confidence to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:13.80,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,It's not that easy to kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:21.30,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,From the moment I came here, I've never \Nshown mercy to students who held me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.60,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.43,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,How would you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:27.23,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:31.81,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,I can see the hints of \Nreluctance behind your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:37.57,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,If you can't even face your own brother, \Nyou're not prepared to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:42.82,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You don't actually know what to do, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:49.64,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,And you've already gotten comfortable \Nin your little class dynamic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:53.51,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You can't possibly be level-headed about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:56.98,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,The only ones who can, maybe, are me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:13:01.36,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,and Sakayanagi, who sees her classmates \Nas nothing more than pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:03.04,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Despite all your confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:05.85,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,you don't really have a way out, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.21,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:12.27,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Because at the end of the day, \Nyou {\i1}will{\i0} be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:15.03,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Which is why I'm sitting \Nback and accepting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:23.24,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Don't let this chance get away, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:30.82,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't actually think I want Ryuen expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.00,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,He's completely bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:37.95,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No matter how he struggles, \Nhe's going to be expelled for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.95,0:13:39.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.51,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,He really may have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:47.78,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Even if he reformed and apologized now, \Nhe'd still get the same negative votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:51.16,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're right. \NA direct engagement wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.44,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Then that's the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:56.90,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But he did have a point back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:58.53,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:05.77,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You probably should face your brother \Nat least once before he graduates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:09.27,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't expect my brother to \Nbe willing to meet with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:14.58,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Much as I dislike it, you're the \Nonly one he has any interest in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.33,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:21.05,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't like how you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:27.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,She still has a powerful \Ncomplex about her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.05,0:14:34.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:38.72,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey, you got any advice for \Nwhat I should do on this test?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:43.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Have any groups begun to form around you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:45.09,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:48.15,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone's afraid of expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:53.01,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So am I! I don't know \Nhow many people hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:56.46,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if you \Nreceived a few negative votes, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:15:00.71,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey, you're supposed to deny \Nthat one, even if it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:03.83,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The best thing to do for now is lie low.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:07.97,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Fine. I won't stir the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:14.07,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But your breakup with Hirata may \Nend up being a point in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.98,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you were still dating Hirata, \Nwho's quite popular with the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:20.99,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,one might have expected there to \Nbe students who wanted to expel you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:23.61,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,in order to drive you two apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:25.33,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Wow, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.95,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,But you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:29.13,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:31.95,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,No one notices you, \Nyour grades are average...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:35.60,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Who are you gonna put in negative votes for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:40.21,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I intend to choose those who will be \Na negative to the class going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.23,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Wow, that's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:44.71,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Though I guess that's what you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:48.05,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If we can't avoid expelling someone, \Nit's the only logical choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:51.47,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not gonna say that's me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:54.54,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're very important to the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:56.44,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd never eliminate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.73,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.38,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I mean, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:04.98,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If groups are forming, votes will likely \Nrelate to something other than grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.19,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:09.70,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you see some guiding principle \Nforming behind negative class votes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.24,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,let me know right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.76,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll call you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:14.74,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Later, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:15.52,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.59,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,He's running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:32.24,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I guess it's really not \Nnice to ambush someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.18,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.23,Flashback,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:41.28,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Morning, Ayanokoji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:42.79,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I'm going on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.23,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.97,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Morning, Ayanokoji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:50.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Oh. Good morning, Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:52.74,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.99,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's another cold day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.51,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:17:00.52,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Have you agreed to walk to school \Nwith anyone in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:02.02,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:05.63,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Then... could I walk with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:06.87,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:14.34,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The upcoming test is going to \Nbe hard on Class B, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:17.46,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh... yeah. I guess it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:20.77,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It might be our hardest test yet, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:21.90,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.15,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But we just have to figure \Nsomething out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.15,0:17:28.03,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're not going to drop out, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.90,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.22,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:38.98,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Your classmates aren't going to \Nwrite your name down, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:42.05,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I didn't say I was going to drop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:43.92,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's written on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.23,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I-Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I didn't mean literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:51.62,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:53.18,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I guess not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.09,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You want to sacrifice yourself \Nto protect someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.61,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Not... quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:03.70,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I just feel like I have to take \Non more risk in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:07.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But let's not get too deep into strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:09.71,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,We're in different classes, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:11.44,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:13.82,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Will you be okay, Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.57,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:22.96,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Would you like me to write you down for \Nmy positive vote for another class?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.17,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not worthy of that vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:29.34,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:31.84,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You're very deserving of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:36.09,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Then I may ask you for that, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.34,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll keep it in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:39.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:44.05,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I really am glad I got \Nto speak with him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:45.45,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.34,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.95,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Well... I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:53.78,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:54.76,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:19:00.62,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Did you find the extra exam unreasonable?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:02.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:04.55,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,There's a reason why they're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:09.88,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,My father, the chairman, \Nwas recently suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.56,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Someone may have a larger plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:21.01,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,This test was arranged at the last \Nminute in order to expel someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:23.63,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Does that seem possible to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:26.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You mean, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:32.70,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It would explain why the school was \Nplotting something this unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:37.78,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Would it mean that man is involved, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:43.29,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That being the case, I'd like \Nto postpone our competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.32,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're free to do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.80,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:50.49,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Now I can focus on matters within Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:52.40,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.20,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Since we're calling a ceasefire,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:20:01.53,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I won't be doing anything to sabotage \Nyou on the test, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:04.03,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to promise that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:09.19,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,If I do end up doing something \Nto damage you in the results,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:14.41,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I will accept it as my own loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:18.41,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You'll be free to refuse our \Nnext competition, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:23.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Though if I end up as a target \Nfor negative votes in this exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:26.07,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,there won't be a next competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:28.08,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That's very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:33.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There won't be any sudden betrayals \Nbefore our fight happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.87,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Surely you jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:43.18,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The moment the test was announced, \NI knew who I was going to expel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:46.18,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Kohei-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:48.12,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's about what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.56,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What does Class C intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:54.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not getting involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:55.85,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:59.54,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,From Class D, I'm sure it will be Ryuen-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.95,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The only mystery is Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:09.11,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Seeing who from that close-knit \Nclass will be expelled
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:12.71,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,will be the greatest \Nenjoyment from this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:17.13,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Now, we'll compete at the last \Nspecial exam of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.11,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:20.72,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:37.44,Flashback,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:39.69,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,President Nagumo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:43.89,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Regarding the private point \Nmatter we discussed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:48.20,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,E-Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:54.46,Flashback,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Date me, Honami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:58.46,Flashback,Nagumo,0,0,0,,That's the condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:00.46,Flashback,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Simple, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:09.00,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I have to protect everyone.
